{"about":["Lara Croft and the Temple of Osiris is the sequel to the critically-acclaimed Lara Croft and the Guardian of Light.","Featuring stunning visuals and a brand-new story, players must work together to explore the temple, defeat hordes of enemies, solve devious puzzles, and avoid deadly traps.","All the while, players will compete for treasure, powerful artifacts, and ultimate bragging rights."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTluAbrdRePDQPuoS1TWxt/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT1_68732.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTluAbrdRePDQPuoS1TWxt/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT1_68732.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTFzN8sbiirko5kvwbJP7G/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT2_68732.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTFzN8sbiirko5kvwbJP7G/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT2_68732.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTjADueDd7l4Ria30CCVCC/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT3_68732.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/cdn/UP0082/CUSA00794_00/FREE_CONTENTjADueDd7l4Ria30CCVCC/PREVIEW_SCREENSHOT3_68732.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}],"summary":""}